{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し第五回目。\nはははっ\nまだまだいくぜいくぜいくぜ〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、今欲しいものある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んとね〜\nニーハイとお洋服かね〜\nいこまは少しずつおしゃれに目覚めてきましたから。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、いこまふぁむにはどうなったらなれる？ぜひ入りたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう入ってますよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2958575/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、握手会に行ったら、ニックネームつけてほしい。\nいいですよ〜☆\nすぐ考えられないけどもな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、上京して最初に大変だと思ったことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車で移動するのが出来なくて泣いた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、好きな数字は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１９"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、新米食べるなら、おかずは何が一番好き？好きなお米の銘柄は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかずはいらない！\n米だけの味がよいよ。\nササニシキを食べてます。\nQ、どんなパジャマ着てる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宇宙柄"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2958575/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、ドラム以外の特技は？\n昼寝。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、マンガ何冊くらい持ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四百はあります。\n数えるの面倒なくらいあるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2958575/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、個別と全握どっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも好きでやんす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2958575/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、生駒ちゃんが好きすぎて辛いんだけど、どうしたらいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず写真でも見てくださいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、行ってみたい国は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスです!!\n町をロリータ着て歩きたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2958575/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、僕は、メンタルが少し弱いのですが、生駒さんが、いつもメンタルで気をつけていること何かありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまり気にしないことが大切だよん!!\n考えすぎない！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2958575/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、最近した小さな決断は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してないですね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、いつ頃結婚したい？何人子供欲しい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来るのかしら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、会ってみたい芸能人は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃりーちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2958575/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ!!\nじゃまたお願いね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}